  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Institutional Strengthening Consultant Capacity Building Costs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Partner Pastoral Social of San Vicente del Caguan (FUNVIPAS in San Vicente del Caguan) who have a grant for the project COL141 which focusses on Strengthening local grassroots capacity on peace, human rights and gender issues and is very weak.  However, they work in an area of very high need and virtually no NGO presence. The area has a significant presence of armed actors and is therefore a very important area in terms of peace building after the peace negotiation. Also, the church will play an extremely important role in peace building.

Therefore, the rational for this project is to continue to build the strategic plan and the strengthening of the San Vicente team which has recently seen many changes. The main aim to have continuity and accompaniment of a very weakened partner. The outcome will be a new three year cycle proposal.</narrative>
  </description>
